---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import Mark from './Mark.astro';
---

<section class="wrap section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <SectionHeading id="about">A bit about <em>me</em></SectionHeading>

  <div class="layout">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I studied AI and machine learning at Anurag University in Hyderabad, and I’m now doing my M.S. in Data Science, Analytics and
        Engineering at Arizona State University.
      </p>
      <p>
        The part I enjoy most is <Mark kind="under">finding out whether something actually works</Mark>. Getting an answer to exactly one
        person in a live meeting, checking which methods still recover a known effect once randomization is gone, seeing where a forecast
        breaks during extreme demand: those are the problems I keep coming back to.
      </p>
      <p>I like work I can measure, and I would rather write down what something can’t do yet than leave it out.</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="margin note" aria-label="Where I studied">
      <p class="route">
        <span>Hyderabad</span>
        <span class="line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Tempe, AZ</span>
      </p>
      <p>B.Tech, AI and Machine Learning<br />Anurag University, 2025</p>
      <p>M.S., Data Science, Analytics and Engineering<br />Arizona State University, May 2027</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding-top: var(--section-gap);
  }

  .layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) var(--width-margin);
    }

    .margin {
      padding-left: var(--space-5);
      border-left: 1px dashed var(--color-rule-strong);
    }
  }

  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    max-width: 40rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.1rem + 0.5vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .prose p:first-child::first-letter {
    float: left;
    margin: 0.06em 0.08em 0 0;
    font-size: 3.4em;
    line-height: 0.8;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--pen);
  }

  .margin {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  .route {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--pen-ink);
  }

  .line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 2.5rem;
    margin-left: 0.5em;
    border-left: 2px dashed var(--pen);
  }
</style>
